{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "tags": [
    "yasdb",
    "loadtest"
  ],
  "title": "yasdb \u2014 load-test resource wall (Fly built-in metrics)",
  "uid": "yasdb-loadtest-wall",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {},
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "app",
        "type": "textbox",
        "label": "App",
        "query": "yasdb",
        "current": {
          "text": "yasdb",
          "value": "yasdb"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "yasdb",
            "value": "yasdb",
            "selected": true
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "device",
        "type": "textbox",
        "label": "Volume device",
        "query": "vdc",
        "current": {
          "text": "vdc",
          "value": "vdc"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "vdc",
            "value": "vdc",
            "selected": true
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU by mode (cores, of 2)",
      "description": "user+system \u2248 2 \u2192 CPU-bound. Large iowait \u2192 parked on the volume. Mostly idle \u2192 neither (serialization).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (mode) (rate(fly_instance_cpu{app=\"$app\"}[1m])) / 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{mode}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volume utilization (device $device)",
      "description": "Fraction of time the volume was busy. \u22481.0 = disk throughput-saturated.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(fly_instance_disk_time_io{app=\"$app\",device=\"$device\"}[1m]) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "util"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volume write latency / await (ms per write)",
      "description": "ms writing \u00f7 writes completed. ~14\u201340ms with low util = latency-bound disk (each flush write slow). ~1ms = disk is fine.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(fly_instance_disk_time_writing{app=\"$app\",device=\"$device\"}[1m]) / rate(fly_instance_disk_writes_completed{app=\"$app\",device=\"$device\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "write await"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Write IOPS by device",
      "description": "Confirms which device gets the writes: vdc=volume, vdb=root.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "iops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (device) (rate(fly_instance_disk_writes_completed{app=\"$app\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volume write throughput",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(fly_instance_disk_sectors_written{app=\"$app\",device=\"$device\"}[1m]) * 512",
          "legendFormat": "write B/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volume I/O in-flight (queue depth)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fly_instance_disk_io_in_progress{app=\"$app\",device=\"$device\"}",
          "legendFormat": "in-flight"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Load average (1m) vs 2 cores",
      "description": "Load \u226b 2 with low CPU busy = tasks blocked in D-state (disk wait).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fly_instance_load_average{app=\"$app\",minutes=\"1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "load1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory available",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "fly_instance_memory_mem_available{app=\"$app\"}",
          "legendFormat": "available"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**user+system \u2248 2** \u2192 CPU-bound (\u2192 `performance-4x`).\n\n**iowait high / util \u2248 1.0 / write await \u2248 14\u201340ms** \u2192 storage-bound (\u2192 faster/bigger volume).\n\n**busy low + iowait low + util low + await ~1ms** \u2192 engine serialization (\u2192 pprof; memory-store A/B confirms).\n\n**load1 \u226b 2 with low CPU** \u2192 disk-wait (D-state)."
      }
    }
  ]
}